### 🧠 Part 2: The Frontend (HTML + JS)

This is where the magic happens. You're gonna write a simple HTML page with a `<textarea>` that updates in real time as other users type. You'll also handle sending updates to the server and receiving them back.

Here's the full HTML/JS code:

